// The sprites of the snake, in cells of 16 pixels: the snake is 10 by 10, so
// that there are three pixels of room all round it, and what it eats and the bonuses
// are 16 by 16, the whole cell. # ink, . paper, _ transparent. The head looks
// four ways, and the tail points away from the body the same four. The icon of
// the game in the gallery is 32 by 32.

